  "limitations": [
    "Finite exact-context reference profile for these four source editions only; not a universal Tol2kit, Gateway, or experimental outcome model.",
    "Variants preserve literal annotated spans from the original lab GenBank members, including 96-base L4, 157-base R1/R2 and 100-base L1/L2. No padding or invented arms.",
    "Full P3 from the cited manufacturer donor is a registered non-LR competitor: the complete 96-base L3 context is its prefix at the same canonical core. Do not treat the donor as an L3 entry or let target matching select a family.",
    "No short B-family documentary contexts are registered. Such shared contexts nest within genuine L/R and cannot globally veto LR family assignments.",
    "The exact known P3 competitor does not exclude unregistered P alleles or other family contexts. Unknown contexts and incomplete scans remain unknown.",
    "Lab source_record.url hashes the original ZIP bytes; exact GenBank member names and SHA256 are in the companion three-entry-source-contexts.README.md. map_url hashes the public source page linking annotated GenBank. Manufacturer source/map hashes are exact TXT/PDF bytes.",
    "ApEinfo:methylated source comments are not interpreted as chemical state; all products here are reference-sequence intent, not atom/strand provenance or measured reaction efficiency.",
    "Independently curated functional attachment-context facts retrieved 2026-11-25, cited to exact original-lab and manufacturer source editions. No whole plasmids, GenBank annotation records, manual text or third-party implementation code are bundled by this profile; no manufacturer endorsement or source-material relicensing is asserted."
